From 50cc72ed9f1522ed9aee90971d88b713362ad841 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:19:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(motion): ignore unused nonpositive 3D stepover

Gate the positivity check by the strategy that reads stepover.
Pin unchanged moves for load strategies and refusals for stepover strategies.
Update the obsolete Adaptive zero-stepover refusal assertion.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1547
